---
import Photo from "../components/Photo.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Dementia Care at Home in Wiltshire & Somerset | Otter Homecare" description="Specialist dementia care at home across Wiltshire & Somerset. A small, familiar team, training co-produced with Alzheimer's Support, built around the person.">
<header class="phero"><div class="wrap">
<div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="/care-services">Our Care</a> · Dementia</div>
<h1>Dementia care, built around the person</h1>
<p>A dementia diagnosis can feel overwhelming — for the person living with it and for everyone around them. With the right support, many people can carry on living well, safely and happily in the home they know and love. That's what we're here for.</p>
</div></header>

<section class="section"><div class="wrap">
<div class="srow reveal">
<div class="srow-media"><Photo src="/img/dem-stay-yourself.jpg" alt="An Otter Care Professional doing a wooden puzzle with an older couple at home" /></div>
<div>
<span class="eyebrow on-clay">Person-centred</span>
<h2 style="font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,40px);margin:10px 0 14px">Care that helps someone stay themselves</h2>
<p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:14px">For someone living with dementia, familiar surroundings — the same rooms, routines, photographs and comforts — can bring real calm. Our job is to make staying at home possible, gently and safely, with a <strong>small, consistent team of familiar faces</strong> rather than a rota of strangers.</p>
<p style="color:var(--muted)">Our Care Professionals are trained in the patient, practical things that help someone feel settled, respected and in control: keeping to routines, communicating calmly, encouraging food and fluids, and finding the moments of connection that make a day better. We build the care around the whole person — their history, their likes, the things that still light them up.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section class="section" style="background:var(--sky)"><div class="wrap">
<div class="mgroup-head reveal" style="max-width:760px"><span class="eyebrow">The standout</span><h2>Training that comes from lived experience</h2></div>
<div class="srow reveal" style="align-items:start;margin-top:30px">
<div>
<p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:14px">We don't just tick a dementia-training box. Our team completed a <strong>full day of dementia training co-produced with Alzheimer's Support</strong>, a local Wiltshire charity, through their <strong>EDUCATE</strong> programme — which means the learning comes directly from <strong>people who actually live with dementia</strong>.</p>
<p style="color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px">It covered understanding behaviour, encouraging nutrition, and communication, and it gave our whole team a <strong>shared language</strong> for dementia care.</p>
<p style="color:var(--muted)">We're also proud supporters of <strong>Beyond Dementia Wiltshire</strong>, joining local efforts like Denim for Dementia and the Memory Walk — because good dementia care extends beyond the front door, into the community.</p>
</div>
<div>
<Photo class="dem-train-img" src="/img/dem-training-session.jpg" alt="The Otter team in a dementia training session, with a trainer presenting a 'Definition of dementia' slide" />
<figure class="dem-quote">
<span class="dq-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
<blockquote>More providers should be doing this.</blockquote>
<figcaption>The EDUCATE trainer, on Otter's approach</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section class="section"><div class="wrap">
<div class="mgroup-head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Real moments</span><h2>The small, true things</h2><p class="lede">A few anonymised moments from our dementia care.</p></div>
<div class="moments-grid">
<div class="moment reveal"><Photo class="m-img" src="/img/rm-horses.jpeg" alt="An Otter Care Professional with a client visiting the horses at a local stable" /><div class="m-body"><h3>A morning with the horses</h3><p>A lady who'd once helped at a local stable, taken to stroke the horses and enjoy coffee and cake. Calm and happy all morning.</p></div></div>
<div class="moment moment-note note-clay reveal">
<span class="mn-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M4.5 12.5a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4zm5-3a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4zm5 0a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4zm5 3a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4zM12 13c-2.8 0-5 1.9-5 4.2 0 1.5 1.1 2.3 2.6 2.3.9 0 1.6-.3 2.4-.3s1.5.3 2.4.3c1.5 0 2.6-.8 2.6-2.3C17 14.9 14.8 13 12 13z"/></svg></span>
<h3>The pet-shop visit</h3>
<p>A lady who loves animals, taken to see the guinea pigs within her usual evening visit. Brighter and more trusting ever since.</p>
</div>
<div class="moment moment-note note-sun reveal">
<span class="mn-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 18V5l10-2v13"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"/><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="3"/></svg></span>
<h3>His music, his identity</h3>
<p>A gentleman who once played in a folk group; our team help him play his organ and old CDs, and he sings along.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="moments-more reveal"><a href="/real-moments">More real moments →</a></div>
</div></section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
<div class="dem-comfort reveal">
<Photo class="dc-img" src="/img/otter-soft-toy.jpg" alt="Two Otter soft toys wearing branded lanyards with a card carrying the emergency number" />
<div class="dc-text">
<h3>A little extra comfort</h3>
<p>Every dementia client can receive a <strong>comforting Otter soft toy</strong> — a friendly, dementia-friendly companion that also quietly carries our emergency number, so help is never far away.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section class="section" style="background:var(--cream-2)"><div class="wrap">
<div class="mgroup-head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Day to day</span><h2>How we help</h2></div>
<ul class="checklist dem-help reveal" style="margin-top:24px;max-width:none">
<li>Personal care, washing and dressing — gently and with dignity</li>
<li>Medication support and prompts</li>
<li>Meals and encouragement to eat and drink</li>
<li>Companionship, familiar routines and getting out and about</li>
<li>Overnight and <strong>live-in care</strong> as needs grow — a warm alternative to a care home</li>
<li>Real-time updates to the family through our <strong>Care App</strong>, for peace of mind</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin-top:24px;color:var(--muted)">As needs change, our <a href="/live-in-care" style="color:var(--clay-text);font-weight:700">live-in care</a> offers round-the-clock support at home, and you can explore the other conditions we care for on our <a href="/conditions" style="color:var(--clay-text);font-weight:700">conditions page</a>.</p>
</div></section>

<section class="section"><div class="wrap">
<div class="srow reveal">
<div>
<span class="eyebrow on-clay">For the family</span>
<h2 style="font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,40px);margin:10px 0 14px">You're never facing it alone</h2>
<p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:14px">Dementia affects everyone around the person, not only the individual.</p>
<p style="color:var(--muted)">We keep families close and informed, and offer honest, jargon-free guidance every step of the way. We share what we've learned from supporting other families living with dementia — and where someone else could help, whether a local group, a charity or a specialist, we'll gladly point you their way or help make the introduction. As things change we adapt the care, so you always know what's happening, and why.</p>
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="#book" style="margin-top:20px">Book a free assessment →</a>
</div>
<div class="srow-media"><Photo src="/img/personal-care-real.jpg" alt="An Otter Care Professional sharing a warm moment with a client" /></div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section class="section book" id="book"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="reveal"> <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#9fc4bf">Free, no-obligation assessment</span> <h2>Let's find the right care, together</h2> <p class="lede">Tell us a little about who needs support and we'll be in touch to arrange a free home visit — at a time that suits you.</p> <div class="reassure"> <div><span class="ic">✓</span> Free, no-obligation home visit</div> <div><span class="ic">✓</span> A tailored care plan, built around you</div> <div><span class="ic">✓</span> Speak to a real local person — never a call centre</div> </div> <div class="callbox"> <small>Prefer to talk? Call us any time</small> <a href="tel:01225690022">01225 690022</a> </div> </div> <div class="reveal"> <form class="form" id="bookForm" action="/api/contact" method="POST" novalidate> <h3>Book a free assessment</h3> <p class="fhint">We usually reply the same day.</p> <input type="text" name="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="display:none"> <div class="frow"> <div class="field"><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="name" type="text" required autocomplete="name" placeholder="Jane Smith"></div> <div class="field"><label for="phone">Phone</label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" required autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" placeholder="07700 900000"></div> </div> <div class="field"><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" placeholder="jane@example.com"></div> <div class="frow"> <div class="field"><label for="who">Who is the care for?</label><select id="who" name="who"><option>My parent</option><option>My partner</option><option>Myself</option><option>Another relative</option><option>Someone else</option></select></div> <div class="field"><label for="area">Your area</label><select id="area" name="area"><option>Trowbridge</option><option>Bradford-on-Avon</option><option>Melksham</option><option>Westbury</option><option>Frome</option><option>Elsewhere nearby</option></select></div> </div> <div class="field"><label for="msg">How can we help? (optional)</label><textarea id="msg" name="msg" placeholder="A little about the support you're looking for…"></textarea></div> <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Request my free assessment →</button> <p class="privacy">Your details are kept private and never shared. See our <a href="/privacy" style="text-decoration:underline">privacy policy</a>.</p> </form> <div class="form-success" id="formSuccess"> <div class="tick">✓</div> <h3>Thank you — we've got it</h3> <p>One of our local team will be in touch very soon to arrange your free visit. If it's urgent, please call <strong>01225 690022</strong>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </section>

<style is:global>
/* Dementia page — small page-specific touches built on brand tokens.
   Deliberate page-local exception (12 Aug 2026 review §3.6): lift into
   otter-home.css at design's next pass, or keep if it stays dementia-only. */
.moment-note{justify-content:center;padding:30px 28px}
.moment-note.note-clay{background:var(--clay-soft);border-color:transparent}
.moment-note.note-sun{background:var(--sun-soft);border-color:transparent}
.moment-note .mn-ic{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}
.note-clay .mn-ic{background:var(--clay);color:#fff}
.note-sun .mn-ic{background:var(--sun);color:#3a2a06}
.moment-note .mn-ic svg{width:26px;height:26px}
/* "How we help" — even 2-column grid so the list reads tidily, not skewy across the full width */
.checklist.dem-help{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px 40px;align-items:start}
@media(max-width:680px){.checklist.dem-help{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.dem-quote{position:relative;background:var(--teal-d);color:#fff;border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:30px 30px 26px;overflow:hidden}
.dem-quote .dq-mark{position:absolute;top:2px;right:20px;font-family:"Spectral",Georgia,serif;font-size:150px;line-height:1;color:var(--sun);opacity:.26;pointer-events:none}
.dem-quote blockquote{margin:0;max-width:22ch;font-family:"Spectral",Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:25px;line-height:1.36;position:relative}
.dem-quote figcaption{margin-top:16px;font-weight:800;color:var(--sun);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase}
.dem-partners{list-style:none;margin:20px 0 0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px}
.dem-partners li{display:flex;gap:11px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45}
.dem-partners li::before{content:"";flex:none;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--teal);margin-top:7px}
.dem-partners strong{color:var(--ink)}
.dem-comfort{display:flex;gap:28px;align-items:center;background:var(--sun-soft);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:24px;max-width:880px;margin:0 auto}
.dem-train-img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/10;object-fit:cover;border-radius:var(--r);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);margin-bottom:18px;display:block}
.dem-comfort .dc-img{flex:none;width:200px;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 40%;border-radius:var(--r);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);display:block}
.dem-comfort .dc-text h3{font-size:21px;margin-bottom:6px}
.dem-comfort .dc-text p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15.5px}
@media(max-width:560px){.dem-comfort{flex-direction:column;text-align:center}.dem-comfort .dc-img{width:100%;max-width:300px}}
@media(max-width:560px){.dem-comfort{flex-direction:column;text-align:center}}
</style>
</SiteLayout>
